lojban please.  For me, using lojban in everyday life, being able to assert
that others UI (with the implicit pe'i) like in ".oiro'o da'oi la nik ta
simlu lo ka cortu (where nick has just faceplanted)" is hella useful.

So just for clarification from other users of da'oi, am I doing it right? Or
should I just start using {.oipeikau} (dunno why I hadn't thought of that
before).
